# Egress allowlist (POSIX extended regex, matched against the destination host).
# With FilterDefaultDeny=Yes, ONLY hosts matching a line here are reachable.

# Claude inference (the headless CLI + the Messages-API client).
^api\.anthropic\.com$

# GitHub: REST API + git clone/fetch over HTTPS (git uses github.com, large
# objects come from codeload).
^api\.github\.com$
^github\.com$
^codeload\.github\.com$

# Google Chat notifications (error alerts + weekly report).
^chat\.googleapis\.com$

# Odoo ticket-analysis callback (ODOO_CALLBACK_URL). NOT used by PR reviews, but
# the ticket-analysis tool runs in this same worker container, so if you enable
# it, add your Odoo host here or its callbacks will be blocked, e.g.:
# ^odoo\.yourcompany\.com$
